WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.980
I'll let you choose.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.840
Mizushima Kiyoi.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.660
Homura Suzuko.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.130
Who wants to play me first?

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.160
I'll—

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.050
I'll go.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:20.750
Suzuko...

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.630
Please, let me do it.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.670
You're my opponent, Homura Suzuko?

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.010
Open!

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:18.650
Unlock. Coin bet!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:27.620
Grow.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.800
Homura Suzuko,

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.840
I've been waiting for my chance to fight you.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.300
Unlock. Coin bet.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:39.930
Coin bet. Joker.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.440
Joker?

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:42.780
Suzu, be careful.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:43.300
Right.

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:44.850
Direct!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.200
That's the pain we LRIGs feel!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:01.780
Suzu!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:02.730
Suzuko!

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:04.790
I'm fine.

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:08.130
You've always endured this, Riru...

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.330
I can, too.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:14.050
The fight's just getting started. 
Let's go, Riru, Meru!

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:15.130
Right!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.480
Let's go, Ruu!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.590
Right!

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.470
I love...

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:28.640
this feeling!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.020
Get Charge!

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:47.530
I won't lose if I'm with Ruu!

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:48.950
Tama...

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:52.780
Just like I thought...

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.650
I felt it the last time we battled.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:59.200
You're just like me!

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.920
I've been waiting for someone like me...

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.370
Someone who feels joy when they 
overwhelm and destroy an enemy,

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.020
just like I do!

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.520
My life is boring as hell.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.460
"I want to battle."

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:20.020
"I want a battle that hurts, 
where we both bet everything we have."

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:22.030
That's all I ever thought...

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.740
Wish.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.240
Tell us your wish.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.570
Do you want to do it?

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.520
Do you want to have a battle?

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.880
A Selector battle.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.200
If you lose, you'll disappear.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.840
Do you still want to fight?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.480
Of course I do.

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.660
That's my wish...

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.720
That's my only wish!

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.650
I was chosen...

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.690
And I met you.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.440
Now, let's have more fun!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.030
We're both the same, so let's 
fight with all we've got!

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.650
No! I'm not like that!

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:08.400
Just admit it! Come on!

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:09.450
You're wrong!

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.050
Ruu...

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:12.400
You're wrong!

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:16.250
Tama and I won't fight battles 
where we lose what we care about!

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.340
Ruuko...

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:21.710
We have to end these battles 
that make everyone suffer!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.550
That's why we fight!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.470
Right, Tama?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.470
Yeah!

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:31.600
I'm ending my battle with you now!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.680
We're ending it!

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.060
So I was wrong...

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.560
Fine. Let's end it.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.400
But it's you who'll be finished!

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.100
Doping!

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.310
She's coming, Ruuko!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:47.140
Right!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.410
Tactical Punish.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.920
<i>I can't defeat her with normal attacks.</i>

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.650
<i>She really is strong!</i>

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.600
Are you underestimating me, Homura Suzuko?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.940
If this is all you've got, 
there's no point in me fighting.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.260
Riru, Meru, let's do this!

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:20.770
Requiem?

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:23.770
Very well.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:28.450
Now I can destroy the horrible 
past where it defeated me!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:29.490
Grow!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.920
Level 5?

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:43.140
Shock.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.670
It wasn't just an urban legend?

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.010
Carnival reached level 5?

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:50.480
The ultimate being, 
who's gone beyond the limits...

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.620
That's what level 5 means!

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.620
Suzu, what do we do?

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:04.980
Let's do it. Requiem.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.480
But she's level 5.

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.440
If it doesn't work...

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.280
Suzu, don't tell me...

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:18.460
Riru, Meru, lend me your strength!

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.120
Coin bet!

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:21.730
Requiem!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.590
Fate Struggle.

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.340
What's this?

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.810
Requiem's power is being erased!

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.610
Riru! Meru!

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:51.790
Did you see that?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.810
This is my power!

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.370
I'm the strongest!

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.360
It's about time for checkmate.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:04.580
Coin bet. Joker. Requiem.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:09.680
Astonishment...

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:12.040
This is a level 5 Requiem?

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:12.670
Suzuko!

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:27.860
Riru! Meru!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.570
Thank you!

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:44.060
Suzuko... I can't believe you...

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.970
I'm sorry. I lost.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.580
It's okay.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.340
You can win, Kiyoi-chan.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.310
Let's finish this.

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.020
Very well.

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:10.610
Open!

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:20.350
Come out, other king.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:21.830
Unlock.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.540
Coin bet.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.170
Kiyoi-chan...

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.390
Lecture!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:43.880
Suzuko-san, you didn't need to take such a 
big risk to show Kiyoi-san how Carnival fights.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.070
I was planning on winning.

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:49.690
But I didn't know there was 
such a thing as level 5.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.040
Still, I think I was a little helpful.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.110
Understanding.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:59.050
Now, let's entrust the rest to Kiyoi-san.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.000
Come on!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.170
You can't even hit me back?!

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:16.660
Tama! Coin bet!

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.060
Innocence!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.380
Spell: Strategy Gale!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:27.350
Tama, attack!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.440
Right!

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.400
You really are just like me!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.200
It's fun beating the hell out of people, isn't it?

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.030
I am not!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.570
You are!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.490
You and I are the same!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.700
That was so fun...

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.730
I'd love to do it again...

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:15.080
Midoriko!

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:15.860
Hanayo-san!

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:17.610
Ruu, I won!

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.730
I was so worried.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:21.280
Where were you?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.540
I was taken to the room of white windows.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.420
But Yuki let me out!

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:26.120
Yuki did?

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:30.140
But Yuki's still there...

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:32.060
Tama.

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.280
Yuki?

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.250
What's wrong, Tama?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.420
I can hear Yuki's voice!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.460
Tama, open the door.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.380
The real door.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.590
The real door?

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:52.300
Tell Ruu to find the room.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:54.310
The room of the beginning of all things.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:57.230
The room of the beginning...

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.800
Activate Joker.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:01.490
Turn Merlin into Shiva.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.490
Lancelot. Attack.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.660
She's losing...

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:16.210
Why doesn't she use her coin skills?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.410
Hypothesis.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:19.980
Perhaps she's waiting for 
some kind of opening?

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:24.210
The room of the beginning of all things?

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:26.970
The real door is there?

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.470
Yeah. Yuki said to find that room.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.920
We have to tell the others!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:33.720
Yeah...

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:42.970
Mizushima Kiyoi.

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:46.450
Are you sure you want to 
end the Selector battles?

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.160
What do you mean?

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.240
I know you realize

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.250
that everyone wants the battles!

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:57.540
We LRIGs can't live without them.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.090
Humans are the same, right?

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:04.590
They're all looking for a place to unleash 
the rage, sadness, and hate in their hearts.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.390
That's why the Selector battles never end.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:12.930
And this is the perfect arena, 
a place for them to do it!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.770
That room is a holy ground for LRIGs.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.400
It has to be protected.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:21.480
Both LRIGs and humans want it.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:22.460
No!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.590
That's not what I want!

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:25.700
Agreement.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:28.840
It's infuriating to hear you say 
everyone shares your personal opinion!

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.230
Then why do the Selector battles still exist?

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:35.210
They don't end because you 
humans don't want them to!

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.250
No...

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:41.040
The Selector battles don't end 
because humans don't want them to.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:43.160
If you call that darkness,

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.940
then the darkness will continue forever...

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.680
That's the truth!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:51.570
Yes.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:54.900
The darkness exists in everyone's heart.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.100
In mine, as well.

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:01.380
But people overcome it to become stronger.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.400
They can find the light beyond the darkness.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:07.530
Friends I truly believe in,

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.450
comrades who believe in me...

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.700
Someone I loved, who believed 
in a person like me.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.880
Even if the darkness is too 
big for me to carry alone,

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:19.520
I can overcome it with someone else's help.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.360
That's what humans are.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.710
That is our strength!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.840
Kiyoi-chan!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:31.680
Then use that strength to stop me!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.760
Grow!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.760
Coin bet!

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:35.810
Joker!

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.740
Doping!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.070
An unending series of 
perfectly arranged battles!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:56.450
That is the new world I'm going to create!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.010
I am a Selector!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.720
I am the one who chooses!

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:02.910
No.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:05.250
You've chosen nothing.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.710
What?

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:10.060
You think you've chosen everything,

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.090
but you were only doing what 
Eternal wanted you to do!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.460
Eternal was also my choice.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:19.240
Everything I did was by my own will...

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:20.480
It was my choice!

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:25.280
If your choice was to be Eternal's pawn,

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.730
then you can't beat us!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.030
I'll prove it.

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.140
Coin bet!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.550
Catharsis!

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.620
What is this?

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:01.470
What did you do?

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.220
I know level 5,

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:07.290
and I know that there's nothing beyond it.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.200
So I raised your level again.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:15.910
The power has gone beyond its limits 
and is going out of control inside you.

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.850
I'm going to lose?

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:22.910
I didn't choose that!

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.070
We didn't choose to be Selectors.

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.670
That's why everyone keeps struggling.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:34.040
But you accepted everything from the start.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:37.390
Just like Eternal, the one 
who chose you, wanted.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.980
No... I'm a Selector...

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.910
I am the only...

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.620
Selector!

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:04.840
Kiyoi-chan, you did it!

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.420
You did it, Kiyoi-san!

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:08.560
It's thanks to you.

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.400
Thank you, Suzuko.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.090
There they are! Kiyoi-chan!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:14.820
Ruuko!

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.600
It looks like this is all of them.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:29.100
Conclusion.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:32.740
The only question left is who goes 
to the room of white windows.

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:36.310
I think Kiyoi-chan should.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:41.080
We only made it this far because of you.

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:47.460
And I believe that you'll 
make the best choice.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:48.930
Agreement.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.940
Suzuko-san's wish, everyone else's hopes...

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:57.220
We'll entrust them all to you, Kiyoi-san.

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:04.680
There's something bothering me...

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:09.350
The room of the beginning of all things?

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.500
The real door is there, she said.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.320
Maybe...

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:20.070
The Selector battles were created when Mayu 
sought a connection with the outside world.

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:18.630
<b>Keep Out</b>

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.780
Everything was born in that room.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:26.750
Maybe that's what Yuki was talking about.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:31.630
I think I have to go there.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.250
For Mayu's sake, as well.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:34.790
Confirmation.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.160
Let's go there.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.220
Yeah.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.950
I forfeit this battle!

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:28.310
Is that... the key?

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:35.860
Tama!

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:41.530
Ruu... I have to go to Yuki.

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:47.040
Go. Be careful.

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:48.510
Okay!

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:57.750
We'll be going, then.

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.450
I am Eternal.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:38.210
Welcome, Selector.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.490
You're...

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.240
Tama!

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.370
It's okay.

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:46.650
I'll save Yuki!

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.920
You found the key.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.030
Open the door.

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:51.750
What is this place?

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.040
Choice / Battle and Battle

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:28.640
This room is yours.

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:30.920
You are the new law.

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:32.040
Why do you end it?

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:33.690
Why do you seek memories?

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:35.760
What waits when you end it?

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:37.720
Nothing but overwhelming force...

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:39.780
This is my battle.

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:41.060
Light

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:41.060
"Light."
